---
/** "Why now" as two cards: what AI assistants did, and what they can do now. Motion only when revealed. */
---

<div class="tn" data-reveal>
  <div class="tn-card tn-then">
    <span class="tn-tag">Then</span>
    <p class="tn-text">You ask. It answers. It forgets.</p>
  </div>
  <span class="tn-arrow" aria-hidden="true">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="28" height="28" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 12h16M14 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
  </span>
  <div class="tn-card tn-now">
    <span class="tn-tag">Now</span>
    <p class="tn-text">It remembers you. It works while you're away. It messages you first.</p>
    <span class="tn-ping" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .tn { display: grid; gap: 0.75rem; align-items: center; justify-items: center; width: 100%; }
  .tn-card { position: relative; width: 100%; max-width: 360px; padding: 1.25rem 1.4rem; border-radius: var(--sg57-radius-lg); background: var(--sg57-glass-bg); border: 1px solid var(--sg57-glass-border); text-align: left; }
  .tn-now { border: 2px solid var(--sg57-accent); background: var(--sg57-accent-glow); box-shadow: 0 0 40px var(--sg57-accent-glow); }
  .tn-tag { display: inline-block; font-family: var(--sg57-font-display); font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.85rem; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--sg57-text-dim); margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
  .tn-now .tn-tag { color: var(--sg57-accent); }
  .tn-text { margin: 0; font-family: var(--sg57-font-display); font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.25rem; line-height: 1.3; color: var(--sg57-text-bright); }
  .tn-then .tn-text { color: var(--sg57-text); }
  .tn-arrow { color: var(--sg57-accent); display: grid; place-items: center; transform: rotate(90deg); }
  .tn-ping { position: absolute; top: -6px; right: -6px; width: 14px; height: 14px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--sg57-accent); box-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--sg57-accent); }
  @media (min-width: 720px) {
    .tn { grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr; }
    .tn-arrow { transform: none; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
    :global(.lo[data-anim]) .tn-card, :global(.lo[data-anim]) .tn-arrow { opacity: 0; }
    :global(.lo[data-anim]) .tn.in .tn-card, :global(.lo[data-anim]) .tn.in .tn-arrow { animation: lo-rise 0.8s var(--sg57-ease-snap, cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1)) both; }
    :global(.lo[data-anim]) .tn.in .tn-arrow { animation-delay: 0.25s; }
    :global(.lo[data-anim]) .tn.in .tn-now { animation-delay: 0.5s; }
    :global(.lo[data-anim]) .tn.in .tn-ping::after { content: ""; position: absolute; inset: -3px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid var(--sg57-accent); animation: lo-ping 1.2s ease-out 1.4s 3 both; }
  }
</style>
